# Heizou Yelan Yae Fischl. ~18s Rot. Heizou Taser in ST w/ P-Amber Heizou, who stays on field until Yae's totems begin to expire. Yae weaves her skill between N1 at the tail of Yelan's burst. EM > ADC in ST. Burstless Yae.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
heizou char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
